## We will build a animation library based on the news awesome gsap from https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.13.0/dist/SplitText.min.js, it has all features now in free.

## Text animation
We will rebuild a text animation. 
Let's take examples : 

<h2
  data-splitting
> Helloo world </h2>

This means that data should be splitted in lines

data-splitting can accept words chars or line, if nothung else setup it fade all lines in stagger.
data-animate can be added for data-animate="fade-in" with a  data-animate="fade-in"
  data-fade-start=between 0 and 1) or a  data-stagger="0.03" also data-animate="slide"
  data-axis="y" accepting y x or z and a value 

  Write a nice html docs using ta&ilwind, put tailwind and gsap lib in common filezs, for now use only gsap as js file. 
  
